  "description": {
    "about": {
      "items": [
        {
          "items": [
            "Coastal Calm | Luxury 30A Retreat Steps from the Beach<br><br>Welcome to Coastal Calm, a luxury seven bedroom retreat located just 0.02 miles from Gulfview Heights Beach Access. Designed for unforgettable group vacations, this home combines the features guests search for most on 30A: a private pool, multiple king suites, walkability to dining, and spacious gathering areas perfect for large families.<br>The layout is especially rare, two complete living spaces under one roof, making it one of the most comfortable homes for multi-family trips along scenic 30A.<br>________________________________________<br>What Makes This Home Stand Out<br>• Steps to beach access (hard to find this close on 30A)<br>• Private resort style pool and backyard<br>• Large luxury home that sleeps 16 comfortably<br>• 3 King master suites<br>• Two full living areas with separate entrances<br>• Perfect for multiple families traveling together<br>• Walk to restaurants and beach access<br>• Balcony overlooking the pool<br>• Complimentary 6 bikes to explore 30A<br>This is exactly the type of property large groups actively search for.<br>________________________________________<br>The Space<br>Coastal Calm was designed to feel like a private coastal resort for your group.<br>Inside, you'll find:<br>• Spacious open living areas for gathering<br>• High-end coastal finishes<br>• Comfortable bedrooms for large groups<br>• Multiple private retreat areas throughout the home<br>Unlike most vacation homes in the area, guests love having two separate living spaces that allow everyone to relax comfortably.<br>Each level includes:<br>• Private entrance<br>• Full kitchen<br>• Living room<br>• Dining area<br>• Washer and dryer<br>This setup is one of the biggest reasons guests book this home over others nearby.<br>________________________________________<br>Bedroom Layout (Sleeps 16)<br>First Floor<br>King Master Suite with spa-style shower<br>King Guest Suite with private bathroom<br>Bunk Suite Oasis – two twin bunk beds + ensuite bath<br>Wet bar with easy access to pool area<br>Second Floor<br>King Master Suite with private ensuite<br>Queen Bedroom<br>Queen Bedroom<br>Queen Bedroom<br>Plenty of space for families, couples, and kids.<br>________________________________________<br>Your Private Backyard Escape<br>After a day at the beach, come back to your own private retreat.<br>• Sparkling private pool<br>• Large outdoor gathering area<br>• Fully fenced backyard<br>• Outdoor seating and lounge areas<br>• Porch swing perfect for evening relaxation<br>Guests often say this is where they spend the most time together.<br>________________________________________<br>One of the Best Locations on 30A<br>Coastal Calm sits in a highly desirable stretch of scenic 30A close to everything guests love.<br>Minutes from:<br>• Grayton Beach<br>• Seaside<br>• Rosemary Beach<br>Nearby dining, shops, and local events at:<br>• Gulf Place<br>Shopping and restaurants at:<br>• Grand Boulevard at Sandestin",
            "Our prices include all fees. No hidden fees."
          ],
